  ],
  "details": "<p>The <em>tribus Velina</em> was organised when Curius Dentatus was censor. Its name derives from the <em>Lacus Velinus,</em> but its location was most likely on the Adriatic coast, presumably in the territory of the <em>Praetuttii</em>.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The tribus Velina was one of the later rural tribes which was established in Rome in 241 B.C.",
